    "created_at": "2017-01-20T16:35:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-20T16:35:35Z",
    "body": "It's sad, but I think we have worse problems, such as not having a clearly defined lifecycle for all our objects, not having clearly defined event loop boundaries, etc. Once all those things are in place it would be a little easier to start talking about what additional work would be needed to allow for multiple processes and how that would change things in an observable manner (via tests or some such).",
