    "created_at": "2017-01-26T23:23:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-26T23:23:03Z",
    "body": "Servo implements cross-process iframes, so we will be implementing the impossible pretty soon. There are some spec issues we know about, e.g. `window.open()`, but I dare say there are lots of unknown unknowns.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
